          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Recycling Services GreenCitizen offers secure and reliable electronics recycling in the San Francisco Bay Area. From responsible computer recycling to IT asset disposal, we ensure your old electronics don&#8217;t end up in landfills."
